FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_NicknamedWardenSlowpoke::
	.string "We nicknamed the WARDEN\n"
	.string "“SLOWPOKE.”\p"
	.string "You know, he has that vacant look\n"
	.string "like a SLOWPOKE.\p"
	.string "He didn't flinch when the haze\n"
	.string "first reached the zone.\p"
	.string "…The rest of us did.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_WardenIsVeryKnowledgeable::
	.string "WARDEN SLOWPOKE is very\n"
	.string "knowledgeable about POKéMON.\p"
	.string "He even has some fossils of rare,\n"
	.string "extinct POKéMON.\p"
	.string "He calls them a warning.\n"
	.string "What the smoke does, given time.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_CouldntUnderstandWarden::
	.string "WARDEN SLOWPOKE came in, but\n"
	.string "I couldn't understand him.\p"
	.string "I think he's got a speech problem!\p"
	.string "…Between us? KOGA INDUSTRIES funds\n"
	.string "half this preserve.\p"
	.string "We bite the hand and we feed from\n"
	.string "it. Awful, isn't it.$"

FuchsiaCity_SafariZone_Office_Text_PrizeInSafariZone::
	.string "Reach the far corner of the\n"
	.string "SAFARI ZONE.\p"
	.string "A prize waits for anyone who\n"
	.string "goes the distance.$"

